{"sections":{"breadcrumbs":{"type":"breadcrumbs","settings":{"text_alignment":"start"}},"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"badges":{"type":"badges","settings":{"show_soldout_badge":true,"show_sale_badge":true,"sale_badge_type":"percentage"}},"title":{"type":"title","settings":{"heading_size":"h4"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"description":{"type":"description","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"inventory":{"type":"inventory","settings":{"text_style":"body","inventory_threshold":20,"show_inventory_quantity":true}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Description","icon":"none","content":"<p>Carabiner style charging cable, upgrade your portable power experience.<\/p><p>This carabiner USB-C charging cable is compact and durable, designed for everyday convenience, delivering maximum power and performance to content creators and technology enthusiasts.<\/p><h2><strong>Compatible with all USB-C devices<\/strong><\/h2><p>The carabiner with charging cable is designed for full-speed charging and high-speed data transfer of various devices. This charging cable ensures seamless compatibility with USB-C-enabled devices.<\/p><h2><strong>Fast charging and data transfer <\/strong><\/h2><p>The carabiner-worn charging cable features a super-fast 240W power output, enabling rapid charging of laptops, tablets, and smartphones. Support USB4, enjoy lightning-fast 40Gbps file transfers and amazing 8K60Hz video output to external displays.<\/p><h2><strong>Convenient daily carry<\/strong><\/h2><p>The carabiner can clip the data cable to a keychain, tech bag, or belt loop. Say goodbye to the trouble of tangled backpack cables. Whether you are commuting, traveling, or shooting outdoors, this data cable is always within reach and ready for you when you need it.<\/p><h2><strong>Rugged and Durable<\/strong><\/h2><p>The carabiner’s charging cable is made of soft-touch TPE material and reinforced with metal connectors to withstand daily wear and tear while remaining flexible. It is also resistant to tangling, fraying, and breaking, even with heavy use.<\/p><p><strong>Why choose the Lumipia Carabiner USB-C Charging Cable?<\/strong><\/p><p>Whether you charge your devices anywhere outdoors, this carabiner charging cable ensures you always have power and a stable connection. No bulk, no clutter – just power in your pocket.<\/p><p>Upgrade your devices today with this must-have mobile accessory – the Carabiner USB-C Charging Cable.<\/p>","custom_liquid":"","page":"","default_open":false}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Size","icon":"none","content":"<ul><li>Mountaineering Buckle: 3 × 1.77 inches<\/li><li>Protective Case: 0.67 × 0.6 inches<\/li><li>Metal Ring Diameter: 0.98 inches<\/li><li>USB4 Cable Length: 5 inches<\/li><li>Product Net Weight: 33g<\/li><\/ul>","custom_liquid":"","page":"","default_open":false}},"collapsible-row-3":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"What's Included","icon":"none","content":"<ul><li>Carabiner*1<\/li><li>USB data cable*1<\/li><li>Plastic bag*1<\/li><li>QR code sticker<\/li><\/ul>","custom_liquid":"","page":"","default_open":false}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button","swatch_type":"color_swatch","button_style":"standard","button_size":40,"size_title":"Size","size_chart_from_page":""}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_quantity_selector":true,"show_dynamic_checkout":true,"show_gift_card_recipient":true}},"custom_liquid_Gc4wdd":{"type":"custom_liquid","settings":{"custom_liquid":"<div style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px 0;\">\n  <h2 style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n    Trusted by Real Creators Like You ⭐\n  <\/h2>\n  <img \n    src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0598\/1044\/7462\/files\/20250616-140009.jpg?v=1750053644\" \n    alt=\"LUMIPIA Trustpilot Rating\" \n    style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: inline-block